"Abrah sent Markus into the goblin bout unarmed, hoping he would die to spite Drathok."
"Markus lied to Drathok to shield Abrah; Drathok thinks one treacherous imp of no importance."
"Abrah tried to abandon Markus in the lower levels; Markus planted a Detonate charge in his chest."
"Markus promised to take the Detonate bomb out of Abrah's chest; it may still be there."
"Abrah guided Markus's treasure hunts below for three silver a chest, and more than a few silver owed."
"From the chests Abrah took about sixty old silver, some two hundred gold and two chameleon potions."
"Abrah means to sell one chameleon potion to alchemists and keep the other."
"Abrah was once a father; his children are dead, and he is bitter and hates himself."
"Abrah told Markus that some monsters below are summons that failed integration, likely in pain."
"Abrah hides what otherworlders usually receive; he started to say it and stopped."
"Abrah thinks Markus a fool not to take a god's deal and live easy."
"Abrah wants Drathok gone."
